# Agent Hooks

The following guardrail hooks are automatically executed to prevent common data engineering errors.

| Hook                           | Purpose                                                                      |
| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| validate-start-date            | Prevent accidental full-history loads caused by missing StartDate parameters |
| validate-lakehouse-path        | Ensure Lakehouse source and target paths exist before execution              |
| validate-incremental-watermark | Ensure incremental loads contain a valid watermark configuration             |

## Design Principles

* Hooks enforce policy, not business logic.
* Hooks should fail fast when required inputs are missing.
* Hooks should provide actionable error messages.
* Hooks should be tested on a branch before merge.

